<div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; max-width:460px"><p class="lede" style="">We love to hear from our wonderful supporters, so please say “Hello”. Ask us about a cat, about fostering, or anything else.</p><p style="margin:0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.7; color:#4F596B; ">[We usually reply within X days.]</p></div>
</div>
</div>
