<div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px; min-width:0"><label for="c-cat" style="font-size:15px; font-weight:500; color:#333333">Name of the cat (if you are asking about one)</label><div class="field" style="display:flex; align-items:center; padding:0 16px; min-height:54px"><input id="c-cat" name="cat" type="text" placeholder="" value="" style="flex:1; min-width:0; min-height:48px; border:0; outline:none; background:transparent; font-family:Montserrat,system-ui,sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-weight:500; color:#333333"></div><span style="font-size:13px; line-height:1.5; color:#4F596B">This helps us pass your message to the right person.</span></div>
<div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px; min-width:0"><label for="c-msg" style="font-size:15px; font-weight:500; color:#333333">Tell us a little about yourself, and the home you could offer if you are asking about a cat <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><div class="field" style="padding:12px 16px"><textarea id="c-msg" name="msg" placeholder="" required style="display:block; width:100%; min-height:170px; border:0; outline:none; resize:vertical; background:transparent; font-family:Montserrat,system-ui,sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; font-weight:500; color:#333333"></textarea></div></div>
<label for="c-news" style="display:flex; gap:14px; align-items:flex-start; min-height:44px; padding:6px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.55; color:#333333; cursor:pointer"><input id="c-news" name="newsletter" type="checkbox" style="flex:none; width:22px; height:22px; margin:1px 0 0; accent-color:#1F3158"><span>I would like to receive the Happy Paws newsletter.</span></label>
<div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; align-items:flex-start">
<button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit" style="min-height:56px">Send message<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" ><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></button>
<p style="margin:0; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:#4F596B; max-width:520px">We use your details only to reply to your message. <a class="link-u" href="/privacy/" style="color:#1F3158; font-weight:500">How we look after your information</a></p>
