<div style="border-top:1px solid #C4CEDD"><details class="faq"><summary>How do I adopt a cat?<svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class=chev><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><p class="faq-a">Choose a cat on our cats page and use the Apply button on their page to fill in our application form. <a class="link-u" href="/adopting/" style="color:#1F3158; font-weight:500">Read how adoption works</a>.</p></details><details class="faq"><summary>I have found a stray, or a cat in need<svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class=chev><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><p class="faq-a">[Add what to do first, how to reach us urgently, and when to contact a vet or another service.]</p></details><details class="faq"><summary>Can I volunteer or foster?<svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class=chev><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><p class="faq-a">Yes, we would love to hear from you. <a class="link-u" href="/foster/" style="color:#1F3158; font-weight:500">Find out about fostering</a>.</p></details></div>
